<title>USA: Seagram's MCA Music's distribution expands.</title>
<headline>Seagram's MCA Music's distribution expands.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uni Distribution, the U.S. sales, marketing and manufacturing arm for MCA Music Entertainment Group, said Monday it has restructured and expanded its operations.</p>
<p>MCA Music Entertainment is a part of MCA Inc, which is a unit of the Seagram Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Under the new structure, Uni Distribution will increase its sales regions from seven to a total of 12.</p>
<p>WIthin each region, the staff of product development representatives will increase significantly, it said.</p>
</text>
